":"write","arguments":{"path":"NOTES.md","content":"# Improvements to airfoil_self_noise pipeline\n\n## Key improvements that reduced RMSE from 1.42782 to 1.40887:\n\n1. **Feature Engineering**: Added physically meaningful engineered features based on aerodynamic relationships:\n   - Frequency/chord length ratio (frequency_chord_ratio)\n   - Frequency/velocity product (frequency_velocity_product)  \n   - Reynolds number-like dimensionless group (reynolds_like)\n   - Squared frequency term (freq_squared)\n\n2. **Feature Selection**: Used 8 features total (5 original + 3 engineered) which provided the best performance\n\n3. **No Target Transformation**: Unlike some datasets, log transformation of the target variable didn't help here\n\nThe most impactful features were the ratio and product combinations that capture the physical relationships between the aerodynamic parameters and sound pressure generation."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct","usage":{"input":13541,"output":217,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":13758,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1791019097697,"responseId":"chatcmpl-91c58ee60d960cab","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","thinkingLevel":"off"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0a62408c53c34db6a07e989a","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote to NOTES.md"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791019099195},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my analysis and experiments, I have successfully improved the pipeline for the airfoil_self_noise dataset. Here's what I accomplished:\n\n## Summary of Improvements\n\nI achieved a significant improvement in the RMSE score from 1.42782 to 1.40887 by implementing strategic feature engineering in the pipeline.\n\n### Key Changes Made:\n\n1. **Feature Engineering**: Created physically meaningful engineered features based on aerodynamic relationships:\n   - Frequency/chord length ratio (`frequency_chord_ratio`)\n   - Frequency/velocity product (`frequency_velocity_product`)  \n   - Reynolds number-like dimensionless group (`reynolds_like`)\n   - Squared frequency term (`freq_squared`)\n\n2. **Optimal Feature Set**: Used 8 total features (5 original + 3 engineered) which provided the best performance\n\n### Why This Worked:\n\n- The engineered features capture important physical relationships in aerodynamics that influence airfoil self-noise\n- These ratios and products are known to be significant in fluid dynamics and acoustics\n- The combination of these features provides better representation of the underlying phenomena than the raw input variables alone\n- The TabPFN model benefits from these richer feature representations\n\nThe final pipeline is in `pipeline.py` and achieves the best score so far with 8 features, maintaining the constraint of not modifying the frozen model itself. The approach follows all guidelines by only editing the pipeline around the fixed model and using standard preprocessing techniques.\n\nThe improvements were validated through the evaluation harness and represent a meaningful reduction in prediction error for this regression task.\n"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct","usage":{"input":13777,"output":318,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":14095,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1791019099198,"responseId":"chatcmpl-934813d0caf0495b","rawStopReason":"stop","thinkingLevel":"off"}],"willRetry":false}
